  "transcript": "Perrin wrote, to declare for the four and keep the break, not on the mud. He handed the pen to Anwen, she signed without saying anything, and so did Jude, who steadied the sheet with his left hand while he wrote Tally, because Ask had said Monday, and it was Monday. Prue went scarlet at the table, for no reason anybody could see, and wrote Finch very small."
